cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SightlineAI or reference its assistive computer vision architecture, please cite it as below."
title: "SightlineAI: AI-Powered Smart Glasses Framework and Edge Computer Vision for the Visually Impaired"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sarker"
    given-names: "Rudra"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-4545-0932"
abstract: "SightlineAI is an open-source assistive technology platform utilizing edge computer vision, real-time spatial object detection, scene narration, and low-latency audio feedback designed for smart glasses hardware to assist visually impaired and blind individuals in navigating dynamic physical environments."
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-26
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rudra496/sightlineai"
url: "https://rudra496.github.io/sightlineai"
keywords:
  - "assistive-technology"
  - "computer-vision"
  - "smart-glasses"
  - "accessibility"
  - "edge-ai"
  - "object-detection"
  - "open-source"
